WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:04.167
♪♪

00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:05.934
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.934 --> 00:00:08.701
The White House announced over
the weekend that a third batch

00:00:08.701 --> 00:00:10.434
of classified documents
was found

00:00:10.434 --> 00:00:12.534
at President Biden's
Delaware home.

00:00:12.534 --> 00:00:16.400
You know, finding new ones
every few days isn't helping.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.200
What are you guys
doing over there?

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.300
Searching one drawer at a time?

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:24.100
Did he hide the documents
in an advent calendar?

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.200
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.801
That's right, a third batch of
classified documents was found

00:00:28.801 --> 00:00:30.434
at President Biden's
Delaware home

00:00:30.434 --> 00:00:32.901
in a room next
to his garage.

00:00:32.901 --> 00:00:37.434
Man, is there a more Biden
hiding place than the room

00:00:37.434 --> 00:00:39.567
next to the garage?

00:00:39.567 --> 00:00:41.801
Just telling neighbors, "Yeah,
sure, you can borrow

00:00:41.801 --> 00:00:45.033
the weed whacker. It's in
the room next to the garage."

00:00:45.033 --> 00:00:47.767
If you hit the nuclear codes,
you've gone too far.

00:00:47.767 --> 00:00:49.067
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.067 --> 00:00:52.167
President Biden visited Ebenezer
Baptist church in Atlanta

00:00:52.167 --> 00:00:54.167
yesterday to honor
Martin Luther King Jr..

00:00:54.167 --> 00:00:56.200
Became the first sitting
President to deliver

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:57.534
a Sunday sermon.

00:00:57.534 --> 00:00:59.133
And I'll tell you what,
when he was done,

00:00:59.133 --> 00:01:01.801
there was not an open eye
in the house.

00:01:01.801 --> 00:01:04.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.934
After the FAA last week
temporarily grounded

00:01:08.934 --> 00:01:11.767
all domestic flight departures
due to a computer outage,

00:01:11.767 --> 00:01:14.334
it's been reported
that the software responsible

00:01:14.334 --> 00:01:16.234
is years away from
a potential update.

00:01:16.234 --> 00:01:19.667
Really? Because I feel like if
you just put Apple in charge,

00:01:19.667 --> 00:01:21.667
they'll update it
every three months.

00:01:21.667 --> 00:01:22.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.968 --> 00:01:25.667
New York mayor Eric Adams
yesterday visited El Paso,

00:01:25.667 --> 00:01:28.000
Texas, to tour immigration
facilities and meet

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:29.033
with local officials.

00:01:29.033 --> 00:01:30.667
Dude, you're the mayor
of New York.

00:01:30.667 --> 00:01:35.367
Why are you wandering all over
the country like a dad at Sears?

00:01:35.367 --> 00:01:36.901
"I'm going to go look
at the tires."

00:01:36.901 --> 00:01:39.901
"Dad, we're here
for my school supplies."

00:01:39.901 --> 00:01:41.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.367
Lottery officials have announced
that the Mega Millions

00:01:43.367 --> 00:01:49.067
$1.35 billion jackpot was won by
a single ticket holder in Maine.

00:01:49.067 --> 00:01:51.167
And if you're wondering what
they're going to buy with that,

00:01:51.167 --> 00:01:52.534
Maine.

00:01:52.534 --> 00:01:54.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.901 --> 00:01:57.400
The national weather service has
warned that a recent drop

00:01:57.400 --> 00:02:00.901
in temperatures in Florida could
cause iguanas to enter

00:02:00.901 --> 00:02:04.767
a dormant state and fall out of
trees, which has left residents

00:02:04.767 --> 00:02:08.100
of Florida scrambling
for recipes.

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:11.100
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.701 --> 00:02:18.200
"Mom, what's in the pasta?"

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:21.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.634 --> 00:02:25.434
The Dallas Zoo was closed
on Friday

00:02:25.434 --> 00:02:28.501
until a 4-year-old
clouded leopard named Nova

00:02:28.501 --> 00:02:30.033
was returned to her habitat.

00:02:30.033 --> 00:02:32.067
Oh, you mean the jungle?

00:02:32.067 --> 00:02:33.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.267 --> 00:02:37.834
News flash -- no leopard's
habitat is Dallas.

00:02:37.834 --> 00:02:41.934
Leopard print, sure,
but not leopard.

00:02:41.934 --> 00:02:44.934
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.367 --> 00:02:48.167
And finally,
Italy's most wanted man,

00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:51.267
an alleged organized crime boss,
Matteo Messina Denaro,

00:02:51.267 --> 00:02:53.367
was arrested today
after 30 years on the run.

00:02:53.367 --> 00:02:56.033
He's expected to serve
at least two life sentences,

00:02:56.033 --> 00:02:57.901
plus five years consulting

00:02:57.901 --> 00:03:00.100
on an HBO series
about his life.

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:01.567
♪♪

00:03:01.567 --> 00:03:05.634
President Biden hosted the NBA
champion Golden State Warriors

00:03:05.634 --> 00:03:06.968
today at the White House,

00:03:06.968 --> 00:03:09.767
where they gave him
an honorary jersey,

00:03:09.767 --> 00:03:13.434
and he gave them the location
of Israel's nukes.

00:03:13.434 --> 00:03:17.200
"Oh, wait, hold on.
I'm gonna need those back."

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:18.801
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.801 --> 00:03:20.133
The White House said yesterday

00:03:20.133 --> 00:03:22.300
that it does not keep
visitor logs

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:24.801
for President Biden's personal
residence in Delaware.

00:03:24.801 --> 00:03:26.467
If you want to know who visited,

00:03:26.467 --> 00:03:32.300
you'll just have to watch
"Jay Leno's Garage."

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:35.300
[As Leno] Eh, I think these are
classified documents.

00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:37.968
[ Laughter ]

00:03:37.968 --> 00:03:39.367
[Normal voice]
Thank you, it was very...

00:03:39.367 --> 00:03:40.701
Oh, yeah.

00:03:40.701 --> 00:03:42.534
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:43.701 --> 00:03:45.534
[ Laughter ]

00:03:45.534 --> 00:03:47.734
Alabama and Mississippi
yesterday observed

00:03:47.734 --> 00:03:51.234
a state holiday that honors
Dr. Martin Luther King Jr.

00:03:51.234 --> 00:03:54.067
and Confederate general
Robert E. Lee.

00:03:54.067 --> 00:03:55.567
I'm sorry, did I say "and"?

00:03:55.567 --> 00:03:58.400
Because I definitely meant "or."

00:03:58.400 --> 00:04:00.968
[ Laughter ]

00:04:00.968 --> 00:04:02.801
"I like 'em both!"

00:04:02.801 --> 00:04:05.133
[ Laughter ]

00:04:05.133 --> 00:04:07.968
In a new episode of a podcast,
former President Trump said

00:04:07.968 --> 00:04:10.767
that he heard Florida governor
Ron DeSantis may challenge him

00:04:10.767 --> 00:04:13.601
for the Republican presidential
nomination, and added, quote,

00:04:13.601 --> 00:04:16.267
"We'll handle that
the way I handle things."

00:04:16.267 --> 00:04:18.100
So get ready, Ron --

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:20.267
he's gonna cheat on you.

00:04:20.267 --> 00:04:22.434
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.434 --> 00:04:24.601
That's how he do.

00:04:24.601 --> 00:04:27.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:27.267 --> 00:04:28.934
When asked in a new interview

00:04:28.934 --> 00:04:30.767
about Senate Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell,

00:04:30.767 --> 00:04:33.267
Louisiana Senator John Kennedy

00:04:33.267 --> 00:04:35.434
said that McConnell
is an enigma,

00:04:35.434 --> 00:04:40.934
and added that he, quote, "saw
him smile once back in 2017."

00:04:40.934 --> 00:04:42.934
Said McConnell, "I remember it.

00:04:42.934 --> 00:04:45.267
It was at the end
of 'Marley &amp; Me.'"

00:04:45.267 --> 00:04:47.601
[ Laughter ]

00:04:47.601 --> 00:04:49.934
[As McConnell]
That was very, uh...

00:04:49.934 --> 00:04:52.601
That Marley finally got
what was coming to him.

00:04:52.601 --> 00:04:53.934
[ Laughter ]

00:04:53.934 --> 00:04:56.100
[ Cackles as McConnell ]

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:58.601
[ Laughter ]

00:04:58.601 --> 00:05:00.133
[Normal voice]
Prince William visited

00:05:00.133 --> 00:05:03.467
the charity Together As One
today for a cooking lesson

00:05:03.467 --> 00:05:05.968
and shared his favorite
cake recipe --

00:05:05.968 --> 00:05:08.467
"tell someone
to make you a cake."

00:05:08.467 --> 00:05:10.501
[ Laughter ]

00:05:13.467 --> 00:05:14.968
[ Chuckles ]

00:05:16.033 --> 00:05:19.300
Missouri DMV officials recently
released a list

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:22.467
of the 500 vanity license plates
that were rejected last year,

00:05:22.467 --> 00:05:26.300
including one that read "GOTAZZ"

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:28.801
on the grounds
of false advertising.

00:05:28.801 --> 00:05:30.534
[ Laughter ]

00:05:32.133 --> 00:05:35.000
The only reason I picked
that joke today --

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:39.000
the writers also describe what
they want in the key over here,

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.334
and the writer wrote,

00:05:40.334 --> 00:05:43.667
"A man with a flat ass,

00:05:43.667 --> 00:05:45.334
shot in profile."

00:05:45.334 --> 00:05:49.000
And I was curious if it would be
clear that he'd got no "azz,"

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:50.834
and, uh...

00:05:50.834 --> 00:05:52.267
totally is.

00:05:52.267 --> 00:05:54.767
[ Laughter ]

00:05:54.767 --> 00:05:57.868
Today was talk show host
Maury Povich's 84th birthday,

00:05:57.868 --> 00:05:59.267
so pretty safe to say

00:05:59.267 --> 00:06:01.501
he's not the father.

00:06:01.501 --> 00:06:03.234
[ Laughter ]

00:06:06.167 --> 00:06:08.167
That joke has a flat ass.

00:06:08.167 --> 00:06:10.167
[ Laughter ]

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:13.767
And finally, according
to a new report,

00:06:13.767 --> 00:06:16.767
three NFL teams are considering
pursuing quarterback Tom Brady

00:06:16.767 --> 00:06:18.100
when he becomes a free agent,

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:20.567
not to mention about
a dozen bocci leagues.

00:06:20.567 --> 00:06:22.000
♪♪

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:23.667
According to a new poll,

00:06:23.667 --> 00:06:26.167
President Biden would defeat
former president Trump

00:06:26.167 --> 00:06:29.701
in a hypothetical 2024
election rematch by 8 points.

00:06:29.701 --> 00:06:33.400
Pretty bad,
but not as defeated as I feel

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:34.968
hearing about that poll.

00:06:34.968 --> 00:06:37.567
Can we not do this yet?

00:06:37.567 --> 00:06:39.701
[ Laughter ]
It's January.

00:06:39.701 --> 00:06:42.634
The only thing I want to hear
less than a presidential poll

00:06:42.634 --> 00:06:44.334
is a Christmas carol.

00:06:44.334 --> 00:06:45.868
[ Laughter ]

00:06:45.868 --> 00:06:47.400
Secretary of State Tony Blinken

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:50.133
sent a cable to all embassies
yesterday

00:06:50.133 --> 00:06:54.200
directing staff to switch from
Times New Roman font to Calibri,

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:57.801
while President Biden will
continue to speak in Wingdings.

00:06:57.801 --> 00:07:00.267
[ Laughter ]

00:07:00.267 --> 00:07:02.434
Georgia congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:07:02.434 --> 00:07:03.634
was assigned yesterday

00:07:03.634 --> 00:07:05.601
to the House Committee
on Homeland Security.

00:07:05.601 --> 00:07:08.367
Well, she does seem
to know about attacks

00:07:08.367 --> 00:07:09.667
before they happen.

00:07:09.667 --> 00:07:12.901
[ Laughter ]

00:07:12.901 --> 00:07:15.634
The Treasury Department
said that tomorrow,

00:07:15.634 --> 00:07:18.033
it will begin using
extraordinary measures

00:07:18.033 --> 00:07:19.834
to keep the federal government
running,

00:07:19.834 --> 00:07:22.501
which explains
this new eBay listing.

00:07:22.501 --> 00:07:26.067
[ Laughter ]

00:07:26.067 --> 00:07:29.133
I think they made a terrible
mistake adding free shipping.

00:07:29.133 --> 00:07:31.267
[ Laughter ]

00:07:31.267 --> 00:07:32.601
According to a new report,

00:07:32.601 --> 00:07:34.534
Republican congressman
George Santos

00:07:34.534 --> 00:07:38.234
allegedly stole $3,000
from a GoFundMe campaign

00:07:38.234 --> 00:07:42.300
for a dying service dog that
belonged to a disabled veteran,

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:46.200
and then get this, he used
the money to buy dog poison.

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:48.934
[ Audience groans ]

00:07:48.934 --> 00:07:51.234
Now, again,
halfway through that joke,

00:07:51.234 --> 00:07:54.167
I started thinking, "How do I
think this is going to go?"

00:07:54.167 --> 00:07:56.133
[ Laughter ]

00:07:58.501 --> 00:08:02.634
It's a bad joke,
but is it as bad...

00:08:02.634 --> 00:08:03.968
as what he did?

00:08:03.968 --> 00:08:06.601
[ Laughter ]

00:08:06.601 --> 00:08:09.634
Still seems like you guys
might think it's a tie.

00:08:09.634 --> 00:08:11.234
[ Laughter ]

00:08:11.234 --> 00:08:14.067
Looks like
I'm Congress material.

00:08:14.067 --> 00:08:17.033
[ Laughter ]

00:08:17.033 --> 00:08:19.234
The Justice Department
this week confirmed --

00:08:19.234 --> 00:08:21.467
[ Laughter ]

00:08:21.467 --> 00:08:24.801
The Justice Department this week
confirmed a new set of policies

00:08:24.801 --> 00:08:27.701
that incentivizes companies
to report wrongdoing

00:08:27.701 --> 00:08:29.734
in exchange for
deferred prosecution,

00:08:29.734 --> 00:08:31.400
which could prevent us
from seeing

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:33.968
over a dozen new limited series.

00:08:33.968 --> 00:08:36.000
[ Laughter ]

00:08:38.934 --> 00:08:41.133
Should we unplug it
and plug it back in?

00:08:41.133 --> 00:08:43.367
[ Laughter ]

00:08:46.234 --> 00:08:49.467
A boy in Maine recently
broke a Guinness world record

00:08:49.467 --> 00:08:52.100
by building a nearly
12,000-piece LEGO set

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:55.367
in just over nine hours, much
to the chagrin of his parents.

00:08:55.367 --> 00:08:58.334
"That was supposed to
take you all year!"

00:08:58.334 --> 00:09:00.400
[ Laughter ]

00:09:02.834 --> 00:09:05.267
New York's Port Authority
announced yesterday

00:09:05.267 --> 00:09:07.634
that it will close
the New Jersey-bound tube

00:09:07.634 --> 00:09:09.834
of the Holland Tunnel next month
for construction.

00:09:09.834 --> 00:09:11.734
So if you need to go
to New Jersey,

00:09:11.734 --> 00:09:14.400
I have even more bad news.

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:16.100
[ Laughter ]

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:21.801
Authorities in Washington State
are looking for a man

00:09:21.801 --> 00:09:24.434
who allegedly tried
to kidnap a barista

00:09:24.434 --> 00:09:28.300
by pulling them through
the drive-through window.

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:30.634
Despite the best efforts
of police,

00:09:30.634 --> 00:09:33.200
the suspect remains at venti.

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:36.167
[ Laughter ]

00:09:36.167 --> 00:09:37.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:37.434 --> 00:09:39.400
Yeah.
I stand by it.

00:09:40.968 --> 00:09:42.167
I stand by it.

00:09:45.234 --> 00:09:47.334
Today was
National Thesaurus Day.

00:09:47.334 --> 00:09:49.000
It was, yeah, good.

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:51.167
[ Laughter ]

00:09:53.734 --> 00:09:57.167
And finally, the world's oldest
known person, a French nun,

00:09:57.167 --> 00:09:59.701
has reportedly died
at the age of 118.

00:09:59.701 --> 00:10:01.801
And I got to say,
I'd feel pretty bad

00:10:01.801 --> 00:10:05.000
if I was the one who bought her
that skateboard.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:07.133
[ Laughter ]

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:15.467
What happened to us?

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:22.968
Well, to be fair,
this is only our fourth show.

00:10:22.968 --> 00:10:25.501
1,389?

00:10:27.868 --> 00:10:28.901
Come on.

00:10:28.901 --> 00:10:30.734
[ Laughter ]

00:10:30.734 --> 00:10:32.501
Now you're going to tell me
it's bad luck

00:10:32.501 --> 00:10:34.334
to make fun
of a dead French nun.

00:10:34.334 --> 00:10:36.267
[ Laughter ]

00:10:39.167 --> 00:10:40.634
Is that her?

00:10:42.534 --> 00:10:44.734
Why did we have to
put her picture up?

00:10:44.734 --> 00:10:46.467
[ Laughter ]

00:10:46.467 --> 00:10:48.100
Oh, good.

00:10:51.234 --> 00:10:53.033
Look, I don't want
to blame this on you guys.

00:10:53.033 --> 00:10:54.434
You've done nothing wrong.

00:10:54.434 --> 00:10:55.434
[ Laughter ]

00:10:55.434 --> 00:10:56.667
♪♪

00:10:56.667 --> 00:10:59.701
President Biden, on Tuesday,
ordered lunch from

00:10:59.701 --> 00:11:02.400
the Washington restaurant
Ghostburger

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:03.834
and got a burger with bacon.

00:11:03.834 --> 00:11:06.100
Wow.
First, the classified documents.

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:08.868
Now bacon burgers.
It's like Trump never left.

00:11:08.868 --> 00:11:11.534
I mean, what is
Biden going to do next?

00:11:11.534 --> 00:11:15.100
Oh, no!

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:18.467
In a series of posts yesterday
on Truth Social,

00:11:18.467 --> 00:11:21.467
former president Trump
pushed back against claims

00:11:21.467 --> 00:11:24.501
that he illegally stored
classified files at Mar-a-Lago

00:11:24.501 --> 00:11:27.968
and accused federal agents
of planting documents

00:11:27.968 --> 00:11:30.567
inside of empty folders
he had taken.

00:11:30.567 --> 00:11:34.501
Oh, you are trying anything.

00:11:34.501 --> 00:11:35.767
That's like telling the police,

00:11:35.767 --> 00:11:37.601
"Someone else
put the cocaine there.

00:11:37.601 --> 00:11:42.467
I just collect
tiny plastic baggies."

00:11:43.934 --> 00:11:45.367
Looks like Trump
has upped his game

00:11:45.367 --> 00:11:51.267
to try and win back the title of
Most Hilarious Liar.

00:11:51.267 --> 00:11:54.067
The first anti-abortion
March for Life rally

00:11:54.067 --> 00:11:56.968
is set to take place tomorrow
in Washington, D.C.,

00:11:56.968 --> 00:11:59.467
since the Supreme Court
overturned Roe vs. Wade.

00:11:59.467 --> 00:12:01.267
Though I'm not sure
their updated chants

00:12:01.267 --> 00:12:02.601
have the same impact.

00:12:02.601 --> 00:12:04.334
"What do we want?"
"Roe overturned."

00:12:04.334 --> 00:12:06.934
"When do we get it?"
"Last year."

00:12:09.567 --> 00:12:13.834
[ Laughter ]

00:12:13.834 --> 00:12:16.033
The Justice Department
announced the arrest of

00:12:16.033 --> 00:12:18.367
the Russian founder of
a cryptocurrency exchange

00:12:18.367 --> 00:12:21.834
in Miami this week on charges of
laundering over $700 million.

00:12:21.834 --> 00:12:26.834
The DOJ first became suspicious
when he was a Russian in Miami.

00:12:28.133 --> 00:12:31.334
Florida governor Ron DeSantis
criticized the NHL last week

00:12:31.334 --> 00:12:33.701
for plans to hold
a hiring event aimed at

00:12:33.701 --> 00:12:35.634
diversifying the
league's workforce.

00:12:35.634 --> 00:12:38.968
Imagine how racist
you have to be

00:12:38.968 --> 00:12:42.701
to think that hockey isn't
white enough.

00:12:45.634 --> 00:12:50.300
[ Cheers and applause ]
Rapper -- This is exciting news.

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:53.200
Rapper Snoop Dogg
is set to be inducted into

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:54.968
the Songwriters Hall of Fame,

00:12:54.968 --> 00:13:02.400
which is the songwriting
profession's highest person.

00:13:02.400 --> 00:13:04.067
According to the latest numbers,

00:13:04.067 --> 00:13:06.033
there are 1,400 stores
in New York that are

00:13:06.033 --> 00:13:09.868
illegally selling marijuana
and at least 1,400 other stores

00:13:09.868 --> 00:13:12.334
that are deeply grateful
for that.

00:13:14.567 --> 00:13:17.267
The Senate Judiciary Committee
has announced

00:13:17.267 --> 00:13:18.834
that it will hold a hearing
next week on

00:13:18.834 --> 00:13:21.734
Ticketmaster's mishandling
of Taylor Swift's ticket sales,

00:13:21.734 --> 00:13:24.834
and even that's sold out.

00:13:26.701 --> 00:13:29.434
According to a new study,
men who take Viagra

00:13:29.434 --> 00:13:32.367
decrease their risk of
developing heart disease

00:13:32.367 --> 00:13:33.601
by nearly 40%.

00:13:33.601 --> 00:13:37.267
So even more bad news
for exhausted grandmas.

00:13:37.267 --> 00:13:42.367
He's going to be around
for a while.

00:13:44.033 --> 00:13:46.000
And, finally,
health officials in Canada

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:47.534
released new guidelines
this week

00:13:47.534 --> 00:13:49.434
that say no amount of alcohol
is healthy.

00:13:49.434 --> 00:13:51.300
But take that with
a grain of salt

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:52.701
and a wedge of lime.

00:13:52.701 --> 00:13:55.067
That was a monologue,
everybody!

00:13:55.067 --> 00:13:58.567
♪♪

00:13:58.567 --> 00:14:00.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

